[{"title":"题挟弹图","author":"陈继","text":"白马雕鞍艳绮罗，东城南陌遍经过。\n金丸且莫轻抛掷，绿树春深乳雀多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13110,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"呈内阁诸老","author":"陈继","text":"白发催年老病身，可堪金屋备词臣。\n东风是处花开落，谁识羲和酿得春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13111,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题月下裁衣图","author":"陈继","text":"香帏风卷月团团，睡起裁衣思万端。\n秋叶未红金剪冷，玉门关外不胜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13112,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟泊常州","author":"钱绅","text":"舟到毗陵日已昏，维舟柳下宿西门。\n几家灯火桥边市，一曲渔歌郭外村。\n远树依微寒鸟集，古城寥落暮云屯。\n相亲喜有同袍客，吟得新诗可细论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13113,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花双鹊图","author":"刘铉","text":"双鹊何处声查查，夭桃一树红蒸霞。\n美人忽听心自喜，卷帘遥对启窗纱。\n恐惊枝上鸟，未折枝上花。\n花任啄残应不惜，早教归信来天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13114,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送杜亚卿赴南京","author":"刘铉","text":"一樽倾罢雨潇潇，客思离情总不消。\n廿载禁林同侍讲，五更青琐共趋朝。\n西风鸿雁南归急，落日云烟北望遥。\n此际送君无限意，疏疏杨柳玉河桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13115,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈孟渊所藏王叔明竹二首 其一","author":"刘铉","text":"风露生寒夜若何，月高山馆觉秋多。\n湘灵正作南归梦，莫向江头唱楚歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13116,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈孟渊所藏王叔明竹二首 其二","author":"刘铉","text":"烟雨苕溪忆旧游，画图遗墨见风流。\n不知黄鹤飞归后，又是山中几度秋？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13117,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感寓三首 其一","author":"徐有贞","text":"阿阁何巍巍，高梁入穹苍。\n飞梯十二重，宛在天中央。\n上当北辰星，下见列宿光。\n清风流绮疏，祥云自飘扬。\n我时临其上，分明望四方。\n山河遥郁盘，宇宙何茫茫。\n威凤去已远，群鸢并翱翔。\n缅怀轩辕氏，徙倚徒徬徨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13118,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感寓三首 其二","author":"徐有贞","text":"七月大火流，西风凉摵摵。\n熠耀飞荒除，络纬鸣虚壁。\n白露下漙漙，明星何历历。\n起视知夜深，斗柄当头直。\n披衣坐不寐，俯仰兴叹息。\n骎骎岁去逝，冉冉老将迫。\n人生天地间，还如逆旅客。\n一过不留名，徒生亦何益。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13119,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感寓三首 其三","author":"徐有贞","text":"结装远行游，驱车北燕路。\n九月气早寒，河冰已堪渡。\n朝别黄金台，夕过望诸墓。\n其人安在哉，风烟宛如故。\n我欲一吊之，凄然感中素。\n战国方力争，智士得乘势。\n出谋契君心，一中如巧注。\n胡为被谗间，而弗永终誉。\n况持孔孟术，十往不一遇。\n虽复逾岁年，何如亟归去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13120,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古从军行三首 其一","author":"徐有贞","text":"塞下日无事，安坐不快心。\n相呼出塞外，驰猎穷山林。\n俯身搏猛虎，翻身射飞禽。\n归来割鲜饮，班坐榆柳阴。\n举杯劝同旅，一一手自斟。\n笑谓灭寇还，为君日挥金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13121,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古从军行三首 其二","author":"徐有贞","text":"朝来射黄羊，驰逐出塞游。\n忽闻匈奴至，万骑寇幽州。\n被袍不及甲，肘挟双刃矛。\n飞身入重围，手取单于头。\n归来饮辕门，独耻非伐谋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13122,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古从军行三首 其三","author":"徐有贞","text":"男儿事征战，所愿树奇勋。\n奈何作奴隶，生死随将军。\n寇来不得击，寇去我始闻。\n顾惭腰间剑，空有星斗文。\n岂不为主用，坐与铅刀群。\n身犹执麾盖，茅土何时分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13123,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"羽林子三首 其一","author":"徐有贞","text":"珠袍年少子，名冠羽林中。\n独佩流星剑，双悬明月弓。\n陪游向何处，还入华清宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13124,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"羽林子三首 其二","author":"徐有贞","text":"羽箭插腰间，骍弓臂上弯。\n自来从日驭，常得近天颜。\n借问归何晚，长杨射猎还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13125,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"羽林子三首 其三","author":"徐有贞","text":"相逢红尘里，勒马共徘徊。\n笑语不及了，同行忽见催。\n问当何处去，明日上之回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13126,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年乐","author":"徐有贞","text":"少年骑骏马，意气两相骄。\n驰骋春风里，人看满渭桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13127,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟唐宫行词乐四首 其一","author":"徐有贞","text":"仙台接建章，御道入长杨。\n户户开妆镜，人人试舞裳。\n禽歌天上曲，树散月中香。\n更觅延生药，年年乐未央。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13128,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟唐宫行词乐四首 其二","author":"徐有贞","text":"太液洞高秋，晴波入晚游。\n露香荷气润，云白柳风柔。\n红袖争牵缆，黄门学棹舟。\n君王回顾笑，妃子唱《齐讴》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13129,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟唐宫行词乐四首 其三","author":"徐有贞","text":"万岁春游罢，还来宴紫微。\n炉薰清宝席，烛影荡绡帏。\n王子吹龙管，仙妃舞羽衣。\n君心殊未乐，潜召念奴归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13130,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟唐宫行词乐四首 其四","author":"徐有贞","text":"绛阙楼台拥，琪园竹树齐。\n飘裳鸲鹆舞，激管鹧鸪啼。\n自会春长在，那知日易西。\n依稀化人国，解使穆王迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13131,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迁秩之后闲居写怀","author":"徐有贞","text":"生平谬拟作真儒，消得闲官只著书。\n微火厝薪犹自若，一绳维木欲何如。\n秋来忽动莼鲈兴，夜梦时寻水竹居。\n行止由天不由己，临风空复赋归欤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13132,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其一","author":"徐有贞","text":"山下云连山上，溪西水接溪东。\n舟度白鸥飞处，人行绿树阴中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13133,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其二","author":"徐有贞","text":"山路只通樵客，江村半是渔家。\n秋水矶边落雁，夕阳影里飞鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13134,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄傲园小景十幅仿卢鸿一草堂图诗自题十首 其一 笼鹅阁","author":"刘珏","text":"谁知轩后阁，宛在水之濆。\n牖外树交合，阶前萍即分。\n鸟窥书影静，鱼伺墨波勤。\n岂有山阴帖，人言此右军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13135,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄傲园小景十幅仿卢鸿一草堂图诗自题十首 其二 斜月廊","author":"刘珏","text":"廊传踏月久，更获此为奇。\n不在照能遍，无妨影乍欹。\n槛承花始韵，檐阁树微亏。\n何以添幽致，恰当弦上时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13136,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄傲园小景十幅仿卢鸿一草堂图诗自题十首 其三 四婵娟堂","author":"刘珏","text":"婵娟何以署，到果趣无涯。\n隙地留移竹，曲阑不辍花。\n暂延人意惬，久坐客心赊。\n剥啄无妨静，深山讵有差。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13137,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄傲园小景十幅仿卢鸿一草堂图诗自题十首 其四 螺龛","author":"刘珏","text":"竟日双扉掩，其中草色新。\n石幢门外树，法相壁间寻。\n借渡石微窄，凿渠雨始深。\n一登绵昼夜，萧寂了无音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13138,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄傲园小景十幅仿卢鸿一草堂图诗自题十首 其五 玉局斋","author":"刘珏","text":"戒时非作态，入室自悠然。\n作古宛如古，可传无意传。\n才情因以胜，位置佐之缘。\n方识命名者，前身玉局仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13139,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄傲园小景十幅仿卢鸿一草堂图诗自题十首 其六 啸台","author":"刘珏","text":"空台超以旷，而亩未能盈。\n缀石仅留意，栽花不在名。\n借池崇地势，待月望山情。\n长啸丰林下，恒思起步兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13140,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄傲园小景十幅仿卢鸿一草堂图诗自题十首 其七 扶桑亭","author":"刘珏","text":"虚亭立水面，问树乃称奇。\n不谓虬龙影，能于隙地垂。\n互承栏并槛，交接涧通池。\n长日披襟坐，摊书尤所宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13141,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄傲园小景十幅仿卢鸿一草堂图诗自题十首 其八 众香楼","author":"刘珏","text":"花扉深不测，危立有层楼。\n遥瞩盈庭树，宛然别一丘。\n坐堪邀月下，登或当山游。\n桂影趋檐际，清芬却想秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13142,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄傲园小景十幅仿卢鸿一草堂图诗自题十首 其九 绣铗堂","author":"刘珏","text":"丽景旁相映，庭空水一湾。\n借庑通竹径，留石让松关。\n客远定须到，诗卑必痛删。\n暗香浮涧外，恍若在深山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13143,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄傲园小景十幅仿卢鸿一草堂图诗自题十首 其十 旃檀室","author":"刘珏","text":"不来深处坐，何以涤吾愁。\n古井汲苔绣，石床吟素秋。\n幽香天际发，奇致室中求。\n僮仆谙清事，支扉谢俗俦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13144,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答陈醒庵二首 其一","author":"刘珏","text":"玉堂仙去白云乡，更喜风流得仲将。\n紫玉制箫吹别调，黄金换酒涤愁肠。\n百年天地双青眼，十亩园林一旧庄。\n记得去年同看竹，水云深处叩僧房。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13145,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答陈醒庵二首 其二","author":"刘珏","text":"画舫频过柳外庄，南溪原得近东阳。\n风来绝涧水无迹，月到空山树有光。\n愁里得诗如老杜，醉中挥墨过颠张。\n别来两月无清约，孤负寒梅一度香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13146,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽夏太常仲昭二首 其一","author":"刘珏","text":"同官十载住京师，一片高情我独知。\n箫管隔云春宴处，佩环摇月早朝时。\n墨翻东绢千竿竹，灯淡西窗数局棋。\n谁道归田犹有乐，胜游常醉习家池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13147,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽夏太常仲昭二首 其二","author":"刘珏","text":"写经谁复换群鹅，故旧其如死别何。\n清泪潺潺流不尽，残星落落已无多。\n天边尺牍催归凤，水上孤城隐去骡。\n日暮不堪东面望，玉峰依旧碧嵯峨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13148,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄沈同斋","author":"刘珏","text":"药栏花径断红尘，坐阅升平五十春。\n茧纸有书皆晋体，锦囊无句不唐人。\n新图写就多酬客，美酒沽来只奉亲。\n昨夜天涯忆君梦，西风吹过楚江滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13149,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其一","author":"刘昌","text":"帘幕深沈柳絮风，象床豹枕画廊东。\n一春空自闻啼鸟，半夜谁来问守宫。\n眉学远山低晚翠，心随流水寄题红。\n十旬不到门前去，零落棠梨野草中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13150,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其二","author":"刘昌","text":"杜鹃残梦五更余，人在长安远索居。\n贝锦有言谗巷伯，黄金无计买相如。\n月明沧海添珠泪，云冷关河滞雁书。\n睡起闲将宫烛剪，蝉纱光映碧窗虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13151,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其三","author":"刘昌","text":"玉鼎清香试水沉，湘帘如雾碧窗深。\n闲中次第占花信，梦里分明见藁砧。\n临镜慵妆蝉钿翠，倚阑失堕凤钗金。\n东风一夜芭蕉绿，亦似含愁卷半心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13152,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其四","author":"刘昌","text":"辞汉仙人去不存，偶因消渴望金盆。\n晚风邻笛吹花落，秋雨门铺上藓痕。\n曾见鸣銮迎帝子，岂知灵鹊误天孙。\n沉香亭北春如海，招得三生石上魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13153,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其五","author":"刘昌","text":"闲门疏雨立清寒，罗帕无人借字看。\n草色天涯迷处所，花阴日午上阑干。\n春情不射屏中雀，秋影孤停镜里鸾。\n碧海茫茫空复夜，西风吹破烂银盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13154,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月三日直内阁杨少保延话率口呈此","author":"刘昌","text":"翠玉楼台映碧虚，上皇曾此驻鸾舆。\n当时官从皆能事，只说相如有谏书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13155,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春鸟图歌","author":"刘昌","text":"王生手持春鸟图，劝我试作春鸟歌。\n凤凰不来碧梧老，喧啾奈此春鸟何。\n黄鹂巧言紫燕舞，名花掩冉薰天和。\n一双飞起白练带，纷纷引类无空柯。\n画眉黄口弄奸丽，白头何事犹奔波。\n瑶池蟠桃实如斗，春光似比人间多。\n青鸾无信灵鹊远，惊波杳渺生银河。\n天孙欲渡未可得，岁月鼎鼎成蹉跎。\n何为一朝亦下集，争雄鼓态翻巢窠。\n不知帝履仁祝网，反说臣尉门张罗。\n呜呼我歌止于此，仙人黄鹤当来过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13156,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒孝陵","author":"刘昌","text":"佳气葱葱山势尊，草香犹藉辇来痕。\n五更月照沧江树，万岁云开飨殿门。\n周后神灵依上帝，汉皇基业付诸孙。\n清平一曲今遭遇，惭愧春晖未报恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13157,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和夏选部齐宿韵四首 其一","author":"刘昌","text":"江郭风涛急晚舂，薄寒消息上梧桐。\n忧添白发三千丈，梦历琼楼十二重。\n龙气谁占冲斗剑，鲸声又起隔烟钟。\n无媒不用逢人叹，且自同歌汉业丰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13158,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和夏选部齐宿韵四首 其二","author":"刘昌","text":"寂寂寒窗隔市舂，峄阳秋思满孤桐。\n省中习静心多感，海上求仙路几重。\n凉月九门闻刻漏，晴云双阙梦朝钟。\n受釐谁得君王赐，应是从容奏岁丰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13159,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和夏选部齐宿韵四首 其三","author":"刘昌","text":"清斋孤悄坐更阑，灯下凉风鬓影寒。\n建业曾劳三尺剑，求仙何用七星坛。\n月明楼影翔丹凤，云烂箫声叫紫鸾。\n岁宴江空身万里，有才不信济时难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13160,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和夏选部齐宿韵四首 其四","author":"刘昌","text":"老鹤无声近石阑，湘帘高卷夜堂寒。\n貂联官列风生坐，佩引仙流月满坛。\n见说千金求骏马，空怜一腐笑鹓鸾。\n移灯催草升平策，万里天门欲献难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13161,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄奚元启顾文之二进士","author":"刘昌","text":"天涯分手叹蹉跎，书剑功名近若何。\n上苑啼莺春信早，楚江归梦月明多。\n旧时诗社谁同饮，长日公庭客少过。\n此意萧条总难写，东风肠断一悲歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13162,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春宫词","author":"夏寅","text":"重重绿树围宫墙，杨花扑人春思长。\n绛缕重封守宫血，翠鬟空学巫山妆。\n监宫夜上金门锁，銮音渐远羊车过。\n熏笼斜倚未成眠，月痕已向楼西堕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13163,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虔州怀古","author":"夏寅","text":"宋家后叶如东晋，南渡虔州益可哀。\n母后撒帘行在所，相臣开府济时才。\n虎头城向江心起，龙脉泉从地底来。\n人代兴亡今又古，春风回首郁孤台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13164,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王给事","author":"夏寅","text":"一语回天事已难，朝居青琐暮蓝关。\n冰霜夜结孤臣思，花柳春融逐客颜。\n楚树荒凉三户县，越山重叠五溪蛮。\n殊方本较长沙远，只是皇恩许便还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13165,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜曲","author":"夏寅","text":"宝鸭烟消几缕香，月移花影过长廊。\n春情一种无聊赖，自起烧灯照海棠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13166,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅边美人","author":"夏寅","text":"欲向东风问早春，闲来花底步香尘。\n试看一种婵娟态，即是罗浮梦里人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13167,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芭蕉美人","author":"夏寅","text":"晓妆才罢思徘徊，罗袜轻移步绿苔。\n试向芭蕉问春信，一缄芳札为谁开？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13168,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宴曲","author":"张和","text":"铜盘绛蜡流晴虹，蜀丝步障围香风。\n瑶钗宝髻光玲珑，红牙按控白纻舞。\n仙袂翩翩欲轻举，惊鸿翻云雏凤语。\n水晶帘箔摇寒星，金鸭脑麝流芳馨。\n兰芽玉茁春娉婷，钿簧悠悠歌宛宛。\n鲸吸流霞恨杯浅，曲阑露寒斜月转。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13169,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰陵秋夕","author":"张和","text":"碧树鸣秋叶，芳塘敛夕波。\n漏长稀箭刻，楼迥逼星河。\n候雁迎霜早，啼螀傍月多。\n怀人不能寐，弹铗起商歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13170,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过桐君山","author":"张和","text":"云断山疑合，川回路忽分。\n秋声两岸叶，晓色万峰云。\n旅雁冲帆度，寒蝉隔水闻。\n严陵遗迹在，我欲问桐君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13171,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰陵秋夕","author":"张和","text":"月砌啼秋蛩，风枝起夜禽。\n洗愁镫下酒，惜别梦中心。\n露重惊寒早，更长觉漏沉。\n明朝览青镜，玄鬓有霜侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13172,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼妾","author":"张和","text":"桃叶歌残思不胜，西风吹泪落红冰。\n乐天老去风情减，子野归来感慨增。\n花逐水流春不管，雨随云散梦难凭。\n宵来书馆寒威重，谁送熏香半臂绫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13173,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送龚进士文彦","author":"张和","text":"雪后关河见雁稀，感时伤别思依依。\n吴门烟月期同醉，天路云山又独归。\n官驿暮帆和雨落，水城寒鸟背人飞。\n京华此去推先达，惆怅丘园只布衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13174,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得柳送人","author":"张和","text":"暖风披拂渐葳蕤，色映鹅黄淡落晖。\n炀帝宫前春漠漠，阖闾城外晚依依。\n青骢每绾长条系，紫燕遥冲落絮飞。\n有客河桥欲分袂，一枝相赠惜相违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13175,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]